285
00:15:05,580 --> 00:15:06,960
Davis, help us!

286
00:15:07,080 --> 00:15:07,962
Come on, Davis.

287
00:15:08,060 --> 00:15:09,337
Aren't you going to help them fight?

288
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:10,580
I just can't do it.

289
00:15:10,760 --> 00:15:12,757
There's a chance I'll hurt Metal Greymon.

290
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,075
You don't understand about friendship.

291
