297
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:35,217
It's not about what you want to do.

298
00:15:35,300 --> 00:15:38,359
It's about the things you
have to do for friendship.

299
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:40,080
Right. Huh? Friendship?

300
00:15:40,760 --> 00:15:41,936
Agumon, don't worry.

301
00:15:42,020 --> 00:15:45,277
