312
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:15,460
Patamon risked his life to save him.

313
00:16:15,580 --> 00:16:17,577
And all you did was stand there and watch.

314
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:18,490
TKI.

315
00:16:18,940 --> 00:16:22,677
Now I'm beginning to understand
what makes friendship so powerful.

316
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:25,637
You have to be willing to do
whatever it takes to protect them.

317
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,014
Because they would do the same for you.

318
00:16:28,340 --> 00:16:29,170
Uh...

319
00:16:29,253 --> 00:16:30,340
Neemon, I'm your friend!

320
00:16:34,620 --> 00:16:35,580
This is new.

321
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,620
His Digivice is responding
to the new Digi-Egg.

322
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:45,801
What's it doing?

323
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,270
Look!

324
00:16:48,353 --> 00:16:50,037
It's stopped right in front of you!

325
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:50,950
Take it!

326
00:16:51,033 --> 00:16:53,197
It's your digi-egg of friendship, Davis!

327
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,920
My digi-egg of friendship?

328
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:59,317
Davis already has the digi-egg of courage,
so how can he now have another one?

329
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:02,871
I think that means that Vemon
can become twice as powerful!

330
00:17:03,020 --> 00:17:04,040
We can win now!

331
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,160
Hey, that's cool!

332
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:07,811
Hey, let's give it a try!

333
00:17:08,820 --> 00:17:10,980
Digi-Armor, energize!

334
00:17:14,060 --> 00:17:17,300
V-Mon, armor, Digi-Bomb, Doom!

335
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:21,800
Digi-Mon, digital monsters,
Digi-Mon are the champions!

336
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:26,260
Armor, Digi-Bomb!

337
00:17:30,740 --> 00:17:33,380
Digi-Mon, digital monsters, Digi-Mon!

338
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:36,320
Wraithramon, the storm of friendship!

339
00:17:39,140 --> 00:17:40,760
I am Paildramon!

340
00:17:41,060 --> 00:17:44,697
As V-mon, I use the Digi-Egg of
Friendship to armor Digivolve!

341
00:17:44,780 --> 00:17:48,545
My blue thunder and electric bite
attacks annihilate my enemies!

342
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:51,622
Finally, someone who can
stand up to the Antworm!

343
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:52,910
Paildramon!

344
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:56,665
Show him who's in charge here!

345
00:17:58,600 --> 00:17:59,600
Blue Thunder!

346
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:02,390
Gotcha!

347
00:18:03,920 --> 00:18:04,920
It's no use!

348
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:06,119
It won't come off!

349
00:18:06,580 --> 00:18:07,420
Ha ha ha!

350
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:09,561
Your weak attempts make me laugh!

351
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,940
Don't worry, Tai.

352
00:18:13,100 --> 00:18:13,997
We won't give up.

353
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,668
We'll get him back for you.

354
00:18:16,080 --> 00:18:17,080
Right, Garurumon?

355
00:18:17,940 --> 00:18:18,770
Right!

356
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,017
Davis, this is a team effort.

357
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:23,017
We're both going to attack
him at the same time.

358
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:23,930
We need you.

359
00:18:24,013 --> 00:18:25,480
I'm not sure. Not sure?

360
00:18:25,740 --> 00:18:28,117
This time you're gonna
do things the right way.

361
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:29,960
How can I? It must.

362
00:18:30,100 --> 00:18:32,200
We'll fight together. You're right.

363
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:35,037
All this time I've been worried about
what's best for me and not the team.

364
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:38,500
Well, you guys can count
on me now. Let's go! Now!

365
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:40,690
Right.

366
00:18:40,773 --> 00:18:41,737
Paildramon, are you ready?

367
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:43,467
Let's give it our best shot.

368
00:18:43,680 --> 00:18:46,240
Digimon, we fight to win. Good luck, guys.

369
00:18:47,380 --> 00:18:48,420
Holy blaster!

370
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,220
Look, it's on!

371
00:19:04,740 --> 00:19:05,570
What?!

372
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:11,860
I'm sorry we attacked you, Agumon.

373
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,260
I'm sorry, too.

374
00:19:14,640 --> 00:19:16,400
I'm sorry that you're sorry.

375
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:19,700
Well, I'm sorry that you're
sorry that I'm sorry.

376
00:19:19,980 --> 00:19:24,509
Tell you what, I won't be sorry anymore,
and you don't be sorry either, okay?

377
00:19:25,860 --> 00:19:26,690
Sorry.

378
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,440
Davis, you saved the day.

379
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:31,365
We thought you were wonderful.

380
00:19:31,540 --> 00:19:32,422
Paildramon, too!

381
00:19:35,640 --> 00:19:36,560
Are you sick?

382
00:19:36,900 --> 00:19:38,457
What's the matter with him?

383
00:19:38,540 --> 00:19:42,187
I'm not sure, but I'm getting
out of here before he throws up.

384
00:19:42,360 --> 00:19:47,420
Davis, you saved Agumon and you didn't
even lose a single hair. Not yet.

385
00:19:47,920 --> 00:19:51,717
I can't believe they were able to
defeat one of my new dark spirals.

386
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:54,497
I'm just going to have to
make them even more powerful.

387
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:57,260
Hey, Ken, is it okay
if I drive for a while?

388
00:19:57,500 --> 00:20:00,697
You said once we took over the
Digi-World and I could drive.

389
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:01,610
Well, can I?

390
