Ken still out there.

395
00:20:17,560 --> 00:20:21,207
Tentomon, I need you to be a spy
and find out what he's up to.

396
00:20:21,820 --> 00:20:23,340
The name's Mon. Tentomon.

397
00:20:23,980 --> 00:20:26,420
Whoa, two digi-eggs? That's cool!

398
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:28,717
