407
00:20:42,200 --> 00:20:45,137
If you're one of the guys now, does that
mean you used to be one of the girls?

408
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:47,397
And how come you never told me about it?

409
00:20:47,480 --> 00:20:49,797
I wish you humans would
just make up your mind.

410
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:52,280
Okay, then how's this for a friendship?

411
00:20:53,740 --> 00:20:56,505
He's not the only one
who's got a lot to learn.

412
00:20:56,860 --> 00:20:58,097
Great. Teach me.

413
00:20:58,180 --> 00:21:00,160
You'll learn soon enough, Davis.

414
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:02,177
Let's just take it one step at a time.

415
00:21:02,260 --> 00:21:04,240
Starting with the noogies. Right!

416
00:21:05,080 --> 00:21:05,910
Oh!

417
00:21:28,180 --> 00:21:29,860
It's a little weird,

418
00:21:30,060 --> 00:21:33,077
it's a little weird I can understand that

419
00:21:33,160 --> 00:21:35,317
I feel like I'm getting
home That's the day

420
00:21:35,400 --> 00:21:37,157
I'm in the middle of the night It's almost

421
00:21:37,240 --> 00:21:44,220
like I'm not feeling that I'm getting home

422
00:21:46,060 --> 00:21:50,620
But I feel that I'm feeling good I
know I'm feeling good I'm feeling bad,

423
00:21:50,800 --> 00:21:51,741
but I'm not sure

424
